  <data key="d35">0.62</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained decline in chokepoint throughput prompts manufacturers and buyers to shorten or regionalize supplier chains and diversify away from long-haul input dependencies, thereby reducing the degree of integration of domestic production in global supplier networks.</data>
