  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden net reduction in crude supply raises energy prices and market risk‑aversion, prompting investors and corporates to reallocate liquidity to energy hedges and safe assets and pause or pull back planned AI financings.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_crisis</data>
