  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Larger crude/hydrocarbon supply disruptions constrain fuel and logistics resupply for forward forces and contractors, directly eroding the alliance's capacity to sustain prolonged operations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">alliance_cred_apac</data>
