  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Major crude supply disruptions push up energy prices and domestic political pressure in Western supplier states, causing governments to curtail, delay or reallocate military aid and procurement budgets and thereby reduce available munitions and materiel shipments destined for Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_crisis</data>
