  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising assessed likelihood of regional escalation triggers governments to tighten export controls, foreign investment screening and security reviews tied to dual‑use AI capabilities, increasing oversight and enforcement intensity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_capital_governance</data>
