  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher assessed risk of escalation drives governments to tighten export controls and regulatory measures on sensitive technologies and dual‑use items targeting adversary supply chains as a precautionary and strategic leverage measure in the tech rivalry.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
