  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perceived escalation risk from an Iran‑Hormuz confrontation constrains Western willingness to undertake high‑risk deterrent measures in Europe and slows deconfliction, which Moscow can interpret as reduced political cost for escalation and therefore increases pressure to escalate in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
