  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible improvements and use of long‑range precision strike systems increase perceived risk to concentrated forward forces, leading allied planners to reduce the frequency/intensity of large forward deployments in APAC in favor of dispersed or deniable postures.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
