  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Reduced throughput from Black Sea/adjacent ports forces cargo onto longer routes and congested chokepoints, lengthening transit times and causing delivery delays for parts and equipment that create logistics and maintenance backlogs in APAC theaters.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
