  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained reductions in regional port throughput due to the war force buyers and manufacturers to re‑route, near‑shore and diversify suppliers, which directly lowers the level of cross‑border supplier integration and deep cross‑border input dependencies.</data>
