  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Physical attacks on energy, fiber and transport infrastructure reduce data‑center uptime and delay deliveries of specialized hardware, directly lowering available training and inference compute.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
