  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased attacks degrading transport and port infrastructure in the Black Sea and surrounding corridors reduce available shipping capacity and raise freight/insurance costs, constraining global container availability and thereby reducing the volume of manufactured exports that China can deliver on existing schedules.</data>
