  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Expanded state export financing, guarantees and subsidies for AI firms improves revenues and reduces investor risk, directly encouraging private and institutional capital allocations into AI ventures and exporters.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
