  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.62</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid increases in state export support (shipping subsidies, preferential charters, flagging assistance) lead Chinese-backed vessels and sanctioned cargoes to continue carrying Iranian crude or sanctioned goods, increasing encounters/interdictions with US/coalition patrols and therefore the frequency of maritime incidents.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
